<h3 id="T023">§2.3　线圈与电容器：原理、单位、电荷与能量、磁芯、电抗与相位差
<span class="small"> · 2.3) Bobines et condensateurs</span>
<span class="anch">#T023</span>
<span class="anch" id="T023a">#T023a</span>
<span class="anch" id="T023c6">#T023c6</span>
<span class="anch" id="T023c8">#T023c8</span>
<span class="anch" id="T023d">#T023d</span>
